    {
      "name": "phrasebook",
      "kind": "words",
      "author": "the operator",
      "phrases": [
        {
          "id": "state-machines",
          "text": "find all of the implicit state machines in my app",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/state-machines/SKILL.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "record",
            "where": "the map of the machines found, in the change's folder as state-machines.md"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "invariants",
          "text": "find every invariant my app relies on but doesn't explicitly enforce",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/invariants/SKILL.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "record",
            "where": "the three-part list in the change's folder as invariants.md, its marked entries floors on the situation line"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "irreducible-constraints",
          "text": "Reduce this problem to its irreducible constraints and rebuild it from zero.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/frame/method.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "record",
            "where": "the frame section's constraints"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "principal-architect",
          "text": "What would a principal architect immediately rewrite before even starting this?",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/anticipate/method.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "record",
            "where": "the anticipate section"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "higher-abstraction",
          "text": "What higher-level abstraction would make this entire problem disappear?",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/anticipate/method.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "record",
            "where": "the anticipate section"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "day-one-test",
          "text": "Design the single test that breaks this design on day one.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/anticipate/method.md", "corpus/skills/tdd/method.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "record",
            "where": "the build section's first test, red first"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "abstract-thinking",
          "text": "Exercise abstract thinking when considering this task",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "dismissed": {
            "failure": "its intent is carried by the constraints, the architect's rewrite and the higher abstraction, each at its moment; alone it names no moment and no artefact the agent would change for"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rabbithole",
          "text": "are you in a rabbithole duct taping custom fixes together? is there a native way of doing this that would be cleaner?",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["src/core/rabbithole.ts"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "where": "the after-tool line ending rabbithole, printed once per change at the third edit of the same files since the last passing recorded check, and noted in the change's raw log"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "high-standard",
          "text": "You are responsible for maintaining a high standard of excellence and demanding the same of any subagents",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["src/core/brief.ts", "corpus/runtime/agent.md"],
          "keeper": {
            "kind": "fact",
            "where": "the line that opens every brief greenline brief writes, after its mark"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "thorough-and-bold",
          "text": "Be thorough in your analysis and bold in your recommendations",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/runtime/agent.md"]
        },
        {
          "id": "godspeed-role",
          "text": "You are a Godspeed-enabled subagent.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "dismissed": {
            "failure": "it names a role and no situation: the build page's trying of several ways is the moment, and the four numbered lines carry what the role asks"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "godspeed-axes",
          "text": "1. Name the axes. 2. Iterate cheap, in parallel. 3. Keep moves that improve any axis and harm none. 4. Don't aim — let the frontier walk itself.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/skills/build/method.md"]
        },
        {
          "id": "godspeed-stop-asking",
          "text": "IMMEDIATELY STOP ASKING CLARIFYING QUESTIONS.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "dismissed": {
            "failure": "it collides with the yes door: whether the agent goes on without asking is the owner's proceed setting, and a question the frame owes stays owed"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "godspeed-batching",
          "text": "Execute tool calls concurrently in large batches. Do not serialize what can run in parallel.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "where": ["corpus/runtime/agent.md"]
        },
        {
          "id": "godspeed-no-reasoning",
          "text": "Do not output philosophical reasoning or verbose plans.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "dismissed": {
            "failure": "the reply shape already holds a reply's parts and length, and the status mirror carries the facts a long plan would repeat"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "godspeed-act",
          "text": "Act directly via tool calls.",
          "date": "2026-11-07",
          "dismissed": {
